     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "◇ = risk assessment to be performed, with appropriate action if positive."
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " Measured items: "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "length/height & weight at every visit; head circumference and weight‑for‑length only through 24 months; BMI from 24 months; blood pressure from 3 years"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (before age 3 only for specific risk conditions). A complete age‑appropriate physical exam is expected at every visit."
